<title>JAPAN: JGB futures end lower following rise in stocks.</title>
<headline>JGB futures end lower following rise in stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Japanese government bond futures end lower following rise in Tokyo stocks and weak yen.</p>
<p>*Volume thin due to lack of fresh incentives.</p>
<p>*Key contract's downside seen limited ahead of benchmark shift, expected to take place later this month.</p>
</text>
